  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2002.05 Opacity Standards for Fuel Burning Devices Subject to 40 CFR 60",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2002.05 Opacity Standards for Fuel Burning Devices Subject to 40 CFR 60. In addition to the opacity standards and exemptions specified in this chapter, those fuel burning devices meeting the applicability requirements of 40 CFR 60 shall meet the applicable opacity standards specified therein.\n\nSource. #6505-B, eff 5-1-97 (formerly Env-A 1202); ss and moved by #8331, eff 4-23-05 (from Env-A 2003.05); ss by #10416, eff 9-24-13; ss by #13809, eff 11-18-23",
